    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE CURSED MAZE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nightmarish labyrinth inhabited by a ruthless demon-like creature, eager to take your soul. Can you outsmart him and find your way to freedom, or will you become another lost soul, forever trapped in the Astral Labyrinth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must become one with the shadows. Remain unnoticed, remain calm, and avoid direct confrontation at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game is 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Walking simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ability to strike an enemy with a flashlight flash<br><br>Update 1.2.0 <br>Added new maps<br> improved AI<br>fixed bug <br>visualization of the maze</p>",
